ke they  might be able to reset their memories  and freeze frame and lullaby which makes  it sound like they might be able to take  control of them in different ways so it  feels like we just scratched the surface  as to what's really going on in the  basement and below harmony getting  canned ahead of her big face to face  with the board wasn't something i was  expecting this could be big considering  she obviously knows a lot about the  company and the eagan family could she  become an ally for her old employees i  mean she was certainly encouraging mark  to get away from lumen at the same time  she's the type of character that it's  hard to imagine her being anything other  than who she is but things are looking  to be pretty well turned upside down  also it sounded like milcheck sent the  pictures to natalie so he might just  step into her role i guess a lot will  depend on what happens with her whenever  mark wakes up in her arms if that  happens so we'll just have to wait and  see the shot with her holding on to the  breathing tube which i presume was her  mother's and all of the strange behavior  related to mark and miss casey certainly  point to her having her own agenda does  this go hand in hand with her being a  true believer or is it at odds with her  devotion to care the sensible wild  speculation seems to be that she's  trying to bring her mother back in the  same way that gemma came back but who  knows how that happened so just to run  back through things before i wrap it up  i guess the big question with dylan is  if he's going to get caught there hasn't  been anyone in the office since greener  died but there is at least a hint that  two people were there when they woke him  up at home while they will need a  replacement for grainer next season i'm  not sure if they'll introduce a brand  new character in the finale with irv it  was nice to see where the black goo the  dirty fingernails and dozing at work was  coming from also his dog being named  ra