ow in the comments what you thought  about this episode how it changed your  ideas about where this is headed which  answers would you most like to get in  the finale because i really don't think  we're gonna get them all and what are  you hoping to see in the next season  there's got to be a next season right  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already and thanks for watching  i'll talk to you soon
 

